Package: ntpdate
Version: 4.1.2-r0
Description: The Network Time Protocol (NTP) is used to synchronize the time of a computer client or server to another server or reference time source, such as a radio or satellite receiver or modem.
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OpenEmbedded Team <oe@handhelds.org>
Architecture: armv5te
Source: http://www.eecis.udel.edu/~ntp/ntp_spool/ntp4/ntp-4.1.2.tar.gz 	   file://configure.patch;patch=1
Depends: libgcc1 (>= 3.4.1), libc6 (>= 2.3.2+cvs20040726)
